# Unit tests go here — one subdirectory per system.

Suggested layout:
  tests/unit/gravity/       → gravity zone + gravity component tests
  tests/unit/movement/      → player movement component tests
  tests/unit/jump/          → jump component tests
  tests/unit/watering/      → plant + watering component tests
  tests/unit/gamemanager/   → GameManager state tests

Test files extend `GdUnitTestSuite` and are named `[system]_[feature]_test.gd`.
